till </span><span begin="00:30.940" end="00:31.510">thinking</span><span begin="00:31.510" end="00:31.510">, </span><span begin="00:31.510" end="00:31.780">let's </span><span begin="00:31.780" end="00:32.310">pretend </span><span begin="00:32.310" end="00:32.400">to </span><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.800">fall </span><span begin="00:32.800" end="00:33.430">asleep </span><span begin="00:33.430" end="00:34.150">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.180" end="00:38.380"><span begin="00:34.180" end="00:34.990">When </span><span begin="00:34.990" end="00:35.440">we </span><span begin="00:35.440" end="00:35.830">get </span><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:36.250">old</span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.250">, </span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.490">will </span><span begin="00:36.490" end="00:36.730">we </span><span begin="00:36.730" end="00:37.450">regret </span><span begin="00:37.450" end="00:38.350">this</span><span begin="00:38.350" end="00:38.380">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.380" end="00:42.700"><span begin="00:38.380" end="00:38.890">Too </span><span begin="00:38.890" end="00:39.460">young </span><span begin="00:39.460" end="00:39.580">to </span><span begin="00:39.580" end="00:40.300">think </span><span begin="00:40.300" end="00:40.810">about </span><span begin="00:40.810" end="00:41.020">all </span><span begin="00:41.020" end="00:41.350">that </span><span begin="00:41.350" end="00:41.680">*</span><span begin="00:41.680" end="00:42.010">*</span><span begin="00:42.010" end="00:42.340">*</span><span begin="00:42.340" end="00:42.700">*</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.700" end="00:48.040"><span begin="00:42.700" end="00:42.850">And </span><span begin="00:42.850" end="00:43.540">stalling </span><span begin="00:43.540" end="00:43.930">only </span><span begin="00:43.930" end="00:44.380">goes </span><span begin="00:44.380" end="00:44.830">so </span><span begin="00:44.830" end="00:45.490">far </span><span begin="00:45.490" end="00:45.760">when </span><span begin="00:45.760" end="00:45.970">you've </span><span begin="00:45.970" end="00:46.360">got </span><span begin="00:46.360" end="00:46.450">a </span><span begin="00:46.450" end="00:46.840">head </span><span begin="00:46.840" end="00:48.040">start</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.220" end="00:52.090"><span begin="00:48.220" end="00:48.490">'Cause </span><span begin="00:48.490" end="00:48.670">we </span><span begin="00:48.670" end="00:48.880">could </span><span begin="00:48.880" end="00:49.300">stay </span><span begin="00:49.300" end="00:49.510">at </span><span begin="00:49.510" end="00:49.840">home </span><span begin="00:49.840" end="00:49.990">and </span><span begin="00:49.990" end="00:50.470">watch </span><span begin="00:50.470" end="00:50.800">the </span><span begin="00:50.800" end="00:52.090">sunset</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.180" end="00:56.080"><span begin="00:52.180" end="00:52.540">But </span><span begin="00:52.540" end="00:52.690">I </span><span begin="00:52.690" end="00:53.050">can't </span><span begin="00:53.050" end="00:53.230">help </span><span begin="00:53.230" end="00:53.530">from </span><span begin="00:53.530" end="00:53.980">asking </span><span begin="00:53.980" end="00:53.980">, </span><span begin="00:53.980" end="00:54.370">"</span><span begin="00:54.370" end="00:54.460">Are </span><span begin="00:54.460" end="00:54.910">you </span><span begin="00:54.910" end="00:55.510">bored </span><span begin="00:55.510" end="00:56.050">yet</span><span begin="00:56.050" end="00:56.050">?</span><span begin="00:56.050" end="00:56.080">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.260" end="01:00.040"><span begin="00:56.260" end="00:56.560">And </span><span begin="00:56.560" end="00:56.740">if </span><span begin="00:56.740" end="00:56.950">you're </span><span begin="00:56.950" end="00:57.460">feeling </span><span begin="00:57.460" end="00:58.000">lonely</span><span begin="00:58.000" end="00:58.000">, </span><span begi